  "question": {
    "text": "If $\\hat{x}, \\hat{y}$ and $\\hat{z}$ are three unit vectors in threedimensional space, then the minimum value of $|\\hat{x}+\\hat{y}|^2+|\\hat{y}+\\hat{z}|^2+|\\hat{z}+\\hat{x}|^2$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "9T4tr",
      "text": "\n$\\frac{3}{2}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "YLHQb",
      "text": "\n3\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "gyHXv",
      "text": "\n$3 \\sqrt{3}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "iKRuY",
      "text": "\n6",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$(\\hat{x}+\\hat{y}+\\hat{z})^2 \\geq 0$\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\Rightarrow 3+2 \\Sigma \\hat{x} \\cdot \\hat{y} \\geq 0 \\\\\n&\\Rightarrow 2 \\Sigma \\hat{x} \\cdot \\hat{y} \\geq-3\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\nNow, $|\\hat{x}+\\hat{y}|^2+|\\hat{y}+\\hat{z}|^2+|\\hat{z}+\\hat{x}|^2$ $=6+2 \\sum \\hat{x} . \\hat{y} \\geq 6+(-3)$\n$$\n\\Rightarrow|\\hat{x}+\\hat{y}|^2+|\\hat{y}+\\hat{z}|^2+|\\hat{z}+\\hat{x}|^2 \\geq 3\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
